sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant E as Entrypoint
    participant A as Application
    participant D as Domain
    participant R as Repository
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    C->>E: GET /catalog/items
    E->>E: Validate query and auth
    E->>A: List items(filter, page)
    A->>D: Apply filtering and ordering rules
    A->>R: Read matching items
    R->>DB: SELECT items
    DB-->>R: Rows
    R-->>A: Domain entities
    A-->>E: Result page
    E-->>C: 200 JSON response

    Note over E,DB: Errors are mapped at the HTTP boundary.
